ionships, Honorary Members and Associates, Women"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:span {} "Not held in other editions"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/959"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "26th Federal Festival, Society and Association Contests, Non-Simultaneous, National Championships, Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "3 –  4 June 1900"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic (non-medal)"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/194"} "Vélodrome Municipal de Vincennes, Paris"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/925256"} "5 from 1 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "There were 29 separate events in the 26th Fête Fédérale de l’Union des Sociétés de Gymnastique de France competitions, which were held during the 1900 Paris International Exposition in the gymnastics category, although not all were gymnastics events, as " [:a {:href "/results/925247"} "fencing"] ", " [:a {:href "/results/925245"} "boxing"] ", and shooting were all contested. There were 8,050 competitors overall in the 29 different events."] "\n\n" [:p {} "This was an individual all-around gymnastics event, with many of the same competitors who competed in the " [:a {:href "/results/70008"} "Olympic all-around"] ", but it cannot be classified as an Olympic competition because it was limited to athletes from the designated societies. The winner was " [:a {:href "/athletes/29985"} "Joseph Martínez"] ", who placed seventh in the Olympic all-around in 1900. One of the runners-up, " [:a {:href "/athletes/29914"} "Lucien Démanet"] ", placed third in the Olympic all-around, and returned in 1920 to win a bronze medal in " [:a {:href "/results/70059"} "team all-around"] " gymnastics. " [:a {:href "/athletes/30022"} "Gustave Sandras"] ", the other runner-up, actually won the 1900 Olympic all-around gymnastics event. This event should be contrasted with the " [:a {:href "/results/925257"} "Olympic Championships for the 26th Fête Fédérale societies"] ", which, despite the title, had no competitors, that we know of, who also competed in the Olympic competitions."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/29985"} "Joseph Martinez"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "230.75"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/29914"} "Lucien Demanet"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "227.00"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/30022"} "Gustave Sandras"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "227.00"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/29878"} "Charles Bollet"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "221.00"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/890942"} "Louis Lallue"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympe